{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I believe that this is the most underrated money making skill in twenty twenty six, twenty seven and and going forward.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker believes that being confident on the streets with a camera is the most underrated money-making skill in the years 2026 and 2027 and beyond."}, "title": "Underrated money-making skill", "topic": "Street camera confidence"}, "content_hash": "78df392b176775daba3c1671baa020fd4833b367bd29f3e63c368cdec9770aee", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:knowledge:d840b65c5063de69", "metadata_hash": "9b385cff1ae180b32667149a567d296bc7ee13a3b35af4d1c763bf994fdf246c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-15", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "a83422fbda509f7db9a3035fc9b9bd40d7b031bf5e3e8575675a45d1e448ab69", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/8xcES_CRIO8", "title": "Underrated money-making skill", "topic": "Street camera confidence", "topic_slug": "street-camera-confidence"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "But your brain is telling you they do judge you, right?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000002"}], "text": "To overcome the feeling of being judged by others while filming on the streets."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "But your brain is telling you they do judge you, right?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000002"}], "text": "Recognize that people might judge you for filming on the streets."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "I know for sure that they will pay any money not to do this. So I am the unique person who in their mind is doing something they're not capable of.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000003"}], "text": "Trick yourself into thinking that these people would pay any money not to film on the streets, thus feeling unique and confident."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "But your brain is telling you they do judge you, right? The way I trick myself, because I still need to do that, is", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000002"}, {"quote": "I know for sure that they will pay any money not to do this. So I am the unique person who in their mind is doing something they're not capable of.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000003"}], "text": "The speaker describes how they trick themselves to overcome the feeling of being judged while filming on the streets."}, "title": "Tricking oneself to overcome judgment", "topic": "Overcoming judgment"}, "content_hash": "78df392b176775daba3c1671baa020fd4833b367bd29f3e63c368cdec9770aee", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:knowledge:46153206b389e439", "metadata_hash": "9b385cff1ae180b32667149a567d296bc7ee13a3b35af4d1c763bf994fdf246c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-15", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "a83422fbda509f7db9a3035fc9b9bd40d7b031bf5e3e8575675a45d1e448ab69", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/8xcES_CRIO8", "title": "Tricking oneself to overcome judgment", "topic": "Overcoming judgment", "topic_slug": "overcoming-judgment"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000003"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "And of course they explain it to themselves like, well why she's doing this? Oh how dare she? Or maybe they don't or maybe they really like Jesus Christ. I wish I could do something like this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:u000003"}], "text": "The speaker presents a hypothetical scenario where bystanders internally justify their judgment as a way to manage their own insecurities about street filming."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Rhetorical strategy on judgment", "topic": "Overcoming judgment"}, "content_hash": "78df392b176775daba3c1671baa020fd4833b367bd29f3e63c368cdec9770aee", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b:expression:ace1531f308bac76", "metadata_hash": "9b385cff1ae180b32667149a567d296bc7ee13a3b35af4d1c763bf994fdf246c", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-04-15", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "a83422fbda509f7db9a3035fc9b9bd40d7b031bf5e3e8575675a45d1e448ab69", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-15-master-street-camera-confidence-underrated-money-skill-short-1b94cfcd2b", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/8xcES_CRIO8", "title": "Rhetorical strategy on judgment", "topic": "Overcoming judgment", "topic_slug": "overcoming-judgment"}
